      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">You have trained your gaze well to see through haze or smog. You do not consider creatures in smoke, haze, or smog from natural heat or non-magical sources concealed to you. You can also see through magical sources of these effects if your level is greater than the effect’s level or half your level rounded up is greater than the spell’s level.</span></p>"
